Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Deadly Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bestowed it with a moniker myself. Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only telling you\Nbecause you're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you bite the dust, I'll\Nbe able to sleep soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, didn't I warn you not\Nto make a move against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to learn\Nthat I mean business!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, color me surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I crushed several of these vermin,\Nyet you remain completely unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move again and I'll slice whatever\Nthat big artery is in your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called the carotid artery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You move a muscle, and I'll have my\Ninvincible harvest hack it to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by the look of\Nthat stand of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it pecks a wallop if you're up close, but\Nit's really shitty when it comes down?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long-range fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess, I'd say it's got\Na range of one, maybe two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and make your move,\Nif you're ready to die, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things, it seems each\Nuser is endowed with a unique ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that's the term you used.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as far as special abilities go, Deadly\NQueen has one that puts others to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.18,0:01:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that in its hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab it, Harvest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a normal 100 yen coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck were you\Nplanning to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.79,0:01:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to reveal what makes Deadly\NQueen such a unique and terrifying stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in keeping its powers\Nsecret when you're already as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen has an astonishing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any object that it touches becomes an\Nexplosive that rips its target asunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, even something as\Nsimple as a hundred yen coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:01:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick harvest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let go of the coin right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.44,0:02:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now a night of glorious sleep awaits.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.80,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
