Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.81,0:03:35.40,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(143,890)\fs60}Episode 22: {\fs80} Kira Yoshikage Wants a Quiet Life Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My face is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen has the ability to transform\Nanything it touches into a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it was doing when you\Nasked about this hundred-yen coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I press the detonator whenever the\Nurge hits me, and once it's triggered,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my victim is blown to\Nsmithereens from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though in your case, Shigechi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it appears the blast partially\Nimploded your malformed face?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving behind a stomach-churning cocktail\Nof facial fascia and cerebral tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I deliver the blow\Nthat ends your wretched life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something of great\Nimportance I must ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier you referred to\Nthis power as a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do the others, Josuke and Okuyasu,\Nalso wield the power of the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die\Nhere, somebody help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death is a necessity at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you know my secret,\NI can't let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing personal,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't allow a single living soul to\Nknow the true nature of Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:05:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I must admit, I find myself\Nfascinated by these stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could figure this out on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd rather use the fleeting\Nresource that lies before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, Okuyasu, who are\Nthe others besides them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many users are residing in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are their powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me go. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know more\Nthan you're letting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you refuse to tell me, your\Nparents will pay for it with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt my mommy and daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't have to if you hurry up\Nand give me the answers I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now quit your stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to slip away before anyone sees me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the names will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hop to it, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone says there was a\Nmurderer in this town and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're all trying to track\Nhim down before he kills again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all making sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The killer they were talking about is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You messed up son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed Reimi Sugimoto too. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little shit can still use his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so close to killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to give him the slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I just have to get to Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I make it there, he can use\Nhis shining diamond to fix me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm going to\Nsit back and die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll protect\Nmy mommy and my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:07:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll fight to keep them\Nsafe from this hand-hoarding monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That horrible creep is rotten to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd rather die than let them live\Nin the same town as my mommy and daddy.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.95,Note,,0,0,0,,High School Ahead. No middle school students beyond this point.\N—Middle School Principal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he heals me, I can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, you're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I wonder what's the\Nmatter with the little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but he looks\Nlike a middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if we can find a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:07:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recall you said something\Nabout people looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean there's\Nsomeone else here who
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knows the truth about\NReimi Sugimoto's murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if there is, they won't\Nbe able to track me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact remains, no one knows\NYoshikage Kira's true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a secret you'll have to carry\Nwith you all the way to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna protect Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but Deadly Queen has already\Nleft its mark on the doorknob.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the genius of my Deadly Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All evidence of my true\Nself has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear someone\Ncall my name just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, most definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you seeing what I'm seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, something's not right, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harvest was limping around and\Nbleeding before it vanished,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's not how a\Nstand usually disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why the heck would only\None of them come to see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head over to the middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find Shigechi right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could I have\Npossibly lost my button?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to visit my tailor\Nand hope he carries the same kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be. Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That foul demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taken another life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another victim screams across the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this keep happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boy has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigekio must have had a\Nrun-in with the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that cost him his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing is sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you must be thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they meet and how was he murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive it was his doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd recognize the handiwork\Nof that murderer anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just looked for Shigeki but\Ncouldn't find him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't get how\Nthis could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only let him out of our\Nsight for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His books and school supplies are\Nin the same place he left them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his parents have filed\Na missing person report?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I doubt anything useful\Nwill turn up at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you saying, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think a stand\Nuser did this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys couldn't possibly know this,\Nbut Shigechi's stand harvest was, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a word, the thing was\Ndamn near invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy killed Shigechi in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he hit his body off\Ncampus without anyone noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there you have it, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious that we're\Ndealing with a murderous stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just sit by and\Nwatch like spectators.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you found a button, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harvest brought it to me\Nbefore falling to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Shigechi's dying message.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very likely Harvest\Npulled it off the murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, we've been given an important clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to investigate\Nthis thing further.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I keep it? Be my guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how much information can you really\Nget from some run-of-the-mill button?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than you would think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might find the brand of the\Nclothes, or even the manufacturer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if we're done with this little\Nmeeting, I think I'm gonna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking about all this is\Nputting me in a weird mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, dad, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't like him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I know how he feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigeji may have come off as\Nan annoying greedy bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there was something\Nundeniably lovable about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't wrapped my head\Naround the fact that he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not sure how to feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know whether to rage at\Nthe world or cry my eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of the most irritating\Nthings you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he feels it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's probably way worse for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could something so horrific be\Nhappening in Mariah right under my nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure all my customers know\Nto keep an eye out for this madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine he would pay me a\Nvisit, but I'll take some precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, stand users have a\Nnasty habit of finding each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, I hope we never meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the time has come for\Nus all to take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was definitely Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Okuyasu is with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you remember how it was\Nmy birthday this past Friday?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that guy I'm seeing\Ndecided to give me a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you can even call it\Nthat, it's just a shitty ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be caught\Ndead wearing this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but for now I have to\Nbe like, oh my god, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I'm only dating him\Nbecause his dad owns some land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's a total hick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet if this crap is\Nthe best he can afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much did it cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing like $150,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want it, I bet you\Ncould sell it at a pawn shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let my beautiful fingers\Nbe sullied by such trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her soul is as grotesque as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But her hands and face are quite lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to set her soul right\Nand show her a glorious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you soon. Okay, then. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time we went our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a good run, but it's over now.
