Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone, and\Nwelcome to Mariah Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Kai Harada, your easy-listening\Ndisc jockey extraordinaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for a magnificent week?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe there are\Nonly three days left to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be out of the house\Ntoday running a few errands,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'd like you to stay put, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll wine and dine when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, they still had some\Nof the Parisian specials left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got here in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head over to Yohei Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Asuka's not here yet. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been four days since we\Nfound out about Shigechi's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been fairly quiet since then, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still a killer lurking\Nsomewhere in the shadows of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes down to it, the\Nmind only sees what it wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The look of guilt and innocence\Nis in the eye of the beholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hi there, Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anything weird stick out to\Nyou during your investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said something about\Nexamining the murderer's button?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully that changes soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'd be a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.60,0:17:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, you headed anywhere in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting the strong silent type\Nto chat is like pulling teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei's pushiness is unsettling,\NBut Jotaro's silence sends me into a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something\Nwe can talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that coat of yours is Bites!
