Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.02,0:18:31.54,Episode 22 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(983.6,760)}We also \Ndo simple\N tailoring!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's certainly convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if anyone ever needs their skirt\Nwaists and pants hemmed high,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know where to send them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, the electronics shop sells flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made you want to stop here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a bit of digging and learned\Nall about the tailors of Morioh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it didn't occur to me till\Nnow to ask about places like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, is there something\Nwrong with the button?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't ring a bell, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't remember what\Nit was originally attached to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, want an animal cracker?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saved the camels for last, but\Neverything else is fair game,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so feel free to take\Nas many as you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but no, I'm fine for now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting back to the point,\Nnot only have I seen it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe it or not, I actually\Njust finished some alterations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the jacket that it belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A customer dropped by yesterday\Nand asked me to replace
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a missing button with the\Nsame kind you brought in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found it, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found what exactly? Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly, what did\Nthe customer look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you recall his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of businessman\Nwould I be if I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of my customers' names\Nis filed away in the old noggin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything less would just be rude\Nto my well-paying clientele.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got thousands of\Nnames locked away in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely incredible, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind telling\Nus who owns that jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess helping you\Nout couldn't hurt nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep the names on the order tags.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you know, I don't need these tags.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the names just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But things tend to run more\Nsmoothly when I have them on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.81,0:20:14.15,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Note: Kira
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.56,0:20:14.15,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Kira
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you read this last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to rush you, sir, but\Nmaybe I can help you figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.02,0:20:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over here. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd my hand explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over here. Ah! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're saying this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep your guard up, Koichi,\Nand don't get any closer to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:20:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, look at the coat rack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The killer is here, and he's\Ntrying to take the jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined someone\Nwould go so far as to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,investigate the button\Nthat fell off my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a careless mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have those two already seen my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have I been faced with\Nnothing but adversity lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This would be when he\Ncomes to get his suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panicking would be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll simply execute them with\NDeadly Queen's Bomb Type II.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that pathetic punk Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's moving again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our evidence! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go blindly after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the way he's pulling the jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is his power?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, it's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.84,0:22:53.22,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.22,0:22:55.47,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.47,0:22:58.27,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.27,0:22:59.94,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.94,0:23:02.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.31,0:23:04.69,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I move so slightly to\Nthe arms and the lips and
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.69,0:23:07.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.14,0:23:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the face of the humic and\Nof all that I need to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.49,0:23:09.20,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to come and stand\Na little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.20,0:23:11.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.45,0:23:13.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.78,0:23:15.41,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.41,0:23:18.04,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.04,0:23:22.54,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.54,0:23:26.09,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I got it if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.00,0:23:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.09,0:23:31.55,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, ooh, I'm done for now.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.55,0:23:34.93,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
